# KinCony F8 (docs/devices/kincony-f8.md). Pins, Ethernet, RTC, on-board IO and the display come
# with the board option (menuconfig: Board). Applied on top of sdkconfig.defaults by the "f8" preset
# (CMakePresets.json):
#   export IDF_PRESET=f8; idf.py build flash monitor
CONFIG_CLU_BOARD_KINCONY_F8=y
